# Purpose: Save the most recent four lines from a build log for a concise handoff.
# Inputs: logs/build.log: chronological build log with one event per line.
# Outputs: reports/latest-build-activity.log: final four log lines; stdout echoes the preview.
accept build_path as text with default "logs/build.log"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["reports"]
run tail with flags ["-n", "4"] and path build_path
then save to "reports/latest-build-activity.log"
